      "message": "\u003e My understanding is that the RO image of the firmware does not change; however, the RW image changes.\n\nCorrect, and since these are in the fingerprint-related code these commands should only be included for RW (double-check).\n\n\u003e I assume through host commands? \n\nYes, the host commands are how the AP sends commands to the FPMCU. \n\nThis macro is part of the [`EC_CMD_FP_MODE`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/include/ec_commands.h;l\u003d8181-8182;drc\u003de6b852b94bb345cb981319aedaf6a7046fb137c4) command, so you\u0027ll want to do a codesearch to see where that command is referenced. (I would expect there to be a command in `libec` and then `biod` is probably using that `libec` command, but there may be other usages.)",
      "parentUuid": "3bf7388d_f791a399",
